  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Setting up a sustainable modern metal company in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Matel Metal B.V. (Matel) is a metalworking company, that is particularly strong in welding and construction of medium to heavy products, mainly for the residential construction market. The company specialises in, among other things, the design, construction and installation of metal stairs and balustrades and other structural steel. Because the company has an innovative production and software system, margins of error are kept to a minimum and quality is guaranteed.In Nigeria, the population is growing rapidly, resulting in a growing need for housing, infrastructure and other construction projects. The Nigerian construction industry is therefore rapidly developing and modernising and the demand for high-quality steel structures for various applications is increasing rapidly.In addition, a very large construction project has started on an island off the coast of Lagos. This offers opportunities for companies that offer sustainable and innovative solutions in the field of steel production, processing and applications.To make good use of the Nigerian market, a local production facility is a must. Matel will therefore set up a sustainable and modern metalworking company in Lagos, where it will produce according to European quality standards.</narrative>
  </description>
